        "product_summary": "Dial-and-cord closure: A rotary dial and four pairs of fabric guides organise the front fastening without traditional tied laces.\nMesh-panel construction: Textured forefoot and side sections sit between curved stitched overlays and a black toe overlay.\nOutlined quarter design: A sweeping side panel and contrasting outline distinguish this style from simpler plain-side sneakers.\nLow-top outdoor styling: A rear pull loop and dark collar meet a sculpted sidewall with segmented black tread sections.\nBlack and Tan EU 39–48: Two neutral colour choices cover ten EU sizes each for wholesale assortment planning.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
